WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.200
-And, finally, this is so cool.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.634
Last night, our pal Aaron Judge

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:06.100
was named the American League's
Most Valuable Player.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.267
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:10.801
And, of course, we wanted to do

00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:13.367
something fun to celebrate.
Take a look.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:16.267
We're at the MLB flagship store
here in New York City

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:20.000
with my pal the
American League MVP Aaron Judge.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.734
We're about to surprise
some baseball fans

00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:23.234
who think they're getting
their photo taken

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:24.567
while pretending to pose

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:27.033
in a batter's box
at Yankee Stadium.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:28.667
[ Laughter ]
Because that's where I see you

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:29.901
all the time --
in the batter's box.

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:30.968
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:30.968 --> 00:00:31.968
You ready for this?

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:33.634
-I'm ready for you to be

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.234
in the Yankee Stadium
all the time.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:37.033
That's the only place to see.

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:38.000
-Let's play ball.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.934
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:44.000
♪♪

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.467
-Hello. How you doing?
-This is our photographer,

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:46.934
Chris.
He's going to set you up.

00:00:46.934 --> 00:00:48.167
-Okay, so stand
in that batter's box.

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:50.634
I'm going to go over here.
Okay, big smiles.

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:52.667
And 1, 2, 3.

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:53.501
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:55.868
-Strike!

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:56.767
I think that was a strike.

00:00:56.767 --> 00:00:58.434
-I think it was a ball.

00:00:58.434 --> 00:00:59.501
-You do?
-Yeah.

00:00:59.501 --> 00:01:01.167
-Yeah, but can I make the call
on this?

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:02.434
-I think I might do it.

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:04.868
[ Laughs ]

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:06.601
-Alright, 3, 2, 1.

00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:07.400
-Here comes the pitch.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.701
-Str-i-i-i-ke!

00:01:09.701 --> 00:01:10.400
Strike!

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.300
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:14.434
Let's ask Aaron Judge.
-Yeah, I thought I was

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:16.367
a little outside, too.

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:17.701
Yeah.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:18.968
-We're on the same page here.
He's got a good eye.

00:01:18.968 --> 00:01:20.167
-No way.
-He's got a good eye.

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:22.200
Yeah.
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.801
-Str-i-i-i-ke

00:01:23.801 --> 00:01:24.501
[ Awws ]
3!

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.334
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:27.567
-That's clearly a ball.

00:01:27.567 --> 00:01:29.667
Balls and strikes.

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:32.100
-If Aaron Judge says
that it's a ball,

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:35.100
then Jimmy Fallon says
it's a strike...

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.567
-What do you guys think,
ball or strike?

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.167
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:01:39.167 --> 00:01:40.534
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:42.067
-Uh!
That was a strike.

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:42.901
-Ball 4.

00:01:42.901 --> 00:01:43.601
-Strike!

00:01:43.601 --> 00:01:44.501
-Take your base.

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:45.567
-Aah!
-That was a strike.

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:46.467
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:01:46.467 --> 00:01:47.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:49.534
-But who would you --
-[Bleep]

00:01:49.534 --> 00:01:50.567
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:52.167
-One more, you're outta here.
-Jerk --

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:53.200
-You're outta here.
-You're going to throw me

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.567
outta here?
-That's it. That's it.

00:01:54.567 --> 00:01:56.033
-[ Laughs ]
-How can you throw me
outta here?

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:57.100
-[Indistinct]

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:57.801
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:57.801 --> 00:01:59.033
-Aaron Judge.

00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:00.400
-3, 2, 1.

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.100
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:03.834
-What?!
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:04.501
-Hey.

00:02:04.501 --> 00:02:05.567
-Jimmy?!
-Yeah.

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:06.734
-What is going on?

00:02:06.734 --> 00:02:08.467
-You know Aaron Judge?

00:02:08.467 --> 00:02:09.934
-Yeah, like my body's
shaking right now.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:12.868
-Yeah.
-Sure.

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:14.200
-Okay.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.033
-You want to stand on the box?
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:15.033 --> 00:02:16.100
-Yeah.
-Even better.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:18.100
Even better.
-Well...

00:02:19.901 --> 00:02:22.300
[Indistinct]

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:25.467
♪♪

00:02:25.467 --> 00:02:26.868
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Oh, my God!

00:02:27.801 --> 00:02:28.901
-We saw 60.
-[Indistinct]

00:02:28.901 --> 00:02:31.067
-Yes!

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:32.133
-Let's get in the pic, too.

00:02:32.133 --> 00:02:33.534
-Oh, my gosh, yeah. What?
-I'm shaking.

00:02:33.534 --> 00:02:34.200
[ Camera shutter clicks ]

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.934
♪♪

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:37.834
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:37.834 --> 00:02:40.000
-My thanks
to Major League Baseball

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.934
and the MLB flagship store.

00:02:41.934 --> 00:02:44.234
And, of course, Aaron Judge!

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:45.467
We love you, bud.
Congrats.

